==Description==
The '''EggHunt Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 24 of the premium [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{Bunz|780}} or {{Robux|108}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bunz|8,990}} or {{Robux|1,960}}.

It is nearly identical to the unreleased [[JellyBeans Nametag]]. It has a purple gradient text with a dark purple outline. There is a purple wave behind the text. Multiple colorful eggs fall out of the nametag.

